<h3 data-start="1527" data-end="1583">Additional question (brief answer, one word is fine)</h3>
<p data-start="1585" data-end="1609">Should the essay end on:</p>
<ul data-start="1611" data-end="1859">
<li data-start="1611" data-end="1665">
<p data-start="1613" data-end="1665"><strong data-start="1613" data-end="1622">Proof</strong> → a formal stability or invariance theorem</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1666" data-end="1733">
<p data-start="1668" data-end="1733"><strong data-start="1668" data-end="1682">Prediction</strong> → falsifiable claims about alignment failure modes</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1734" data-end="1787">
<p data-start="1736" data-end="1787"><strong data-start="1736" data-end="1747">Warning</strong> → a sharp civilizational risk statement</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1788" data-end="1859">
<p data-start="1790" data-end="1859"><strong data-start="1790" data-end="1800">Vision</strong> → a detailed picture of what a working solution looks like</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="1861" data-end="1888">(You can choose one or two)</p>
