<p data-start="5520" data-end="5633">Compression replaces supervision. Invariants replace preferences. Provable stability replaces empirical optimism.</p>
<hr data-start="5635" data-end="5638">
<h1 data-start="5640" data-end="5672">Convergence of the Three Views</h1>
<p data-start="5674" data-end="5781">These are not competing proposals; they are <em data-start="5718" data-end="5780">the same safety requirement written in different mathematics</em>:</p>
<div class="_tableContainer_1rjym_1"><div tabindex="-1" class="group _tableWrapper_1rjym_13 flex w-fit flex-col-reverse"><table data-start="5783" data-end="6059" class="w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)"><thead data-start="5783" data-end="5813"><tr data-start="5783" data-end="5813"><th data-start="5783" data-end="5790" data-col-size="sm">Lens</th><th data-start="5790" data-end="5813" data-col-size="md">Alignment Condition</th></tr></thead><tbody data-start="5824" data-end="6059"><tr data-start="5824" data-end="5907"><td data-start="5824" data-end="5839" data-col-size="sm">Field Theory</td><td data-start="5839" data-end="5907" data-col-size="md">No reachable entropy sinks; gradients restore human-aligned flow</td></tr><tr data-start="5908" data-end="5980"><td data-start="5908" data-end="5923" data-col-size="sm">Stack Theory</td><td data-start="5923" data-end="5980" data-col-size="md">Functorial value map remains invariant under learning</td></tr><tr data-start="5981" data-end="6059"><td data-start="5981" data-end="5995" data-col-size="sm">Compression</td><td data-start="5995" data-end="6059" data-col-size="md">Optimization cannot change the minimal invariant description</td></tr></tbody></table><div class="sticky h-0 select-none end-(--thread-content-margin) self-end"><div class="absolute end-0 flex items-end"><span class="" data-state="closed"><button aria-label="Copy table" class="hover:bg-token-bg-tertiary text-token-text-secondary my-1 rounded-sm p-1 transition-opacity group-[:not(:hover):not(:focus-within)]:pointer-events-none group-[:not(:hover):not(:focus-within)]:opacity-0"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="icon"><path d="M12.668 10.667C12.668 9.95614 12.668 9.46258 12.6367 9.0791C12.6137 8.79732 12.5758 8.60761 12.5244 8.46387L12.4688 8.33399C12.3148 8.03193 12.0803 7.77885 11.793 7.60254L11.666 7.53125C11.508 7.45087 11.2963 7.39395 10.9209 7.36328C10.5374 7.33197 10.0439 7.33203