<p data-start="5896" data-end="5921">Or in a single statement:</p>
<blockquote data-start="5923" data-end="6103">
<p data-start="5925" data-end="6103"><strong data-start="5925" data-end="6103">A system is aligned if and only if optimization can improve competence without altering purpose, and this invariance can be demonstrated without appeal to behavioral testing.</strong></p>
</blockquote>
<hr data-start="6105" data-end="6108">
