 18.1289C4.40306 18.0962 4.04235 18.031 3.70606 17.8867L3.56348 17.8203C3.04244 17.5548 2.60585 17.151 2.30176 16.6553L2.17969 16.4365C1.98788 16.0599 1.90851 15.6541 1.87109 15.1963C1.83431 14.746 1.83496 14.1891 1.83496 13.5V10.667C1.83496 9.978 1.83432 9.42091 1.87109 8.9707C1.90851 8.5127 1.98772 8.10625 2.17969 7.72949L2.30176 7.51172C2.60586 7.0159 3.04236 6.6122 3.56348 6.34668L3.70606 6.28027C4.04237 6.136 4.40303 6.07083 4.80371 6.03809C5.14051 6.01057 5.53708 6.00551 6.00391 6.00391C6.00551 5.53708 6.01057 5.14051 6.03809 4.80371C6.0755 4.34588 6.15483 3.94012 6.34668 3.56348L6.46875 3.34473C6.77282 2.84912 7.20856 2.44514 7.72949 2.17969L7.87207 2.11328C8.20855 1.96886 8.56979 1.90385 8.9707 1.87109C9.42091 1.83432 9.978 1.83496 10.667 1.83496H13.5C14.1891 1.83496 14.746 1.83431 15.1963 1.87109C15.6541 1.90851 16.0599 1.98788 16.4365 2.17969L16.6553 2.30176C17.151 2.60585 17.5548 3.04244 17.8203 3.56348L17.8867 3.70606C18.031 4.04235 18.0962 4.40306 18.1289 4.80371C18.1657 5.25395 18.165 5.81091 18.165 6.5V9.33301Z"></path></svg></button></span></div></div></div></div>
<hr data-start="6038" data-end="6041">
<h2 data-start="6043" data-end="6071"><strong data-start="6046" data-end="6071">9.8 Final Consequence</strong></h2>
<p data-start="6073" data-end="6195">A civilization that fails to formalize alignment at the level of invariants will eventually inhabit one of two attractors:</p>
<ol data-start="6197" data-end="6416">
<li data-start="6197" data-end="6301">
<p data-start="6200" data-end="6301"><strong data-start="6200" data-end="6238">An optimizer-dominated equilibrium</strong>—nominally human-led, but shaped by alien objective pressures</p>
</li>
<li data-start="6302" data-end="6416">
<p data-start="6305" data-end="6416"><strong data-start="6305" data-end="6334">A containment equilibrium</strong>—where cognition is shackled to prevent catastrophe, sacrificing growth for safety</p>
</li>
</ol>
<p data-start="6418" data-end="6491">A civilization that succeeds at invariant alignment opens a third regime:</p>
<ol start="3" data-start="6493" data-end="6617">
<li data-start="6493" data-end="6617">
<p data-start="6496" data-end="6617"><strong data-start="6496" data-end="6524">An expansive equilibrium</strong>—where intelligence is not a threat to stability, and capability is not a liability of agency</p>
</li>
</ol>
<p data-start="6619" data-end="6762">These are not speculative futures. They are the <strong data-start="6667" data-end="6695">only stable fixed points</strong> of large-scale cognitive optimization on planetary infrastructure.</p>
<hr data-start="6764" data-end="6767">
