<h3 data-start="2973" data-end="3019">(c) Add a short paragraph explaining that:</h3>
<ul data-start="3020" data-end="3148">
<li data-start="3020" data-end="3044">
<p data-start="3022" data-end="3044"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>h</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">S_h</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.8333em; vertical-align: -0.15em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.05764em;">S</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.3361em;"><span style="top: -2.55em; margin-left: -0.0576em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight">h</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">​</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.15em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> is not learned</p>
</li>
<li data-start="3045" data-end="3086">
<p data-start="3047" data-end="3086">It is <strong data-start="3053" data-end="3086">specified as a prior manifold</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start="3087" data-end="3148">
<p data-start="3089" data-end="3148">Learning occurs in its tangent bundle, not transverse to it</p>
</li>
</ul>
