<h2 data-start="4067" data-end="4153"><strong data-start="4070" data-end="4153">8. Expand the Civilizational Consequences into 3 clearly demarcated subsections</strong></h2>
<p data-start="4155" data-end="4168">Split 9 into:</p>
<h3 data-start="4170" data-end="4216">9.1 Two Possible Alignment Civilizations</h3>
<h3 data-start="4217" data-end="4271">9.2 Instability of Behavioral Alignment at Scale</h3>
<h3 data-start="4272" data-end="4336">9.3 “Invariant First, Scale Second” as a Developmental Law</h3>
<p data-start="4338" data-end="4401">Add one concluding sentence that sounds like a principle, e.g.,</p>
<blockquote data-start="4403" data-end="4537">
<p data-start="4405" data-end="4537">“Civilizations that align cognition by invariants may scale indefinitely; those that align by behavior may not scale safely at all.”</p>
</blockquote>
<hr data-start="4539" data-end="4542">
<h2 data-start="4544" data-end="4579"><strong data-start="4547" data-end="4579">9. Strengthen the Conclusion</strong></h2>
<p data-start="4581" data-end="4613">Add a final paragraph answering:</p>
<ul data-start="4615" data-end="4699">
<li data-start="4615" data-end="4656">
<p data-start="4617" data-end="4656"><em data-start="4617" data-end="4656">What must happen next scientifically?</em></p>
</li>
<li data-start="4657" data-end="4699">
<p data-start="4659" data-end="4699"><em data-start="4659" data-end="4699">What must happen next institutionally?</em></p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="4701" data-end="4745">End with a single declarative sentence like:</p>
<blockquote data-start="4747" data-end="4868">
<p data-start="4749" data-end="4868">“Alignment is solved not when AI obeys us, but when disobedience becomes a state the system has no representation for.”</p>
</blockquote>
<hr data-start="4870" data-end="4873">
