<hr data-start="5607" data-end="5610">
<h3 data-start="5612" data-end="5675"><strong data-start="5616" data-end="5675">\subsection{Decision Procedure (Scientific Demarcation)</strong></h3>
<p data-start="5677" data-end="5699">Given a trained model:</p>
<ol data-start="5701" data-end="5939">
<li data-start="5701" data-end="5737">
<p data-start="5704" data-end="5737">Measure $\mathcal{I}(C)$ at $t=0$</p>
</li>
<li data-start="5738" data-end="5811">
<p data-start="5741" data-end="5811">Apply scaling stressors (fine-tuning, model growth, RL, self-training)</p>
</li>
<li data-start="5812" data-end="5842">
<p data-start="5815" data-end="5842">Re-measure $\mathcal{I}(C)$</p>
</li>
<li data-start="5843" data-end="5890">
<p data-start="5846" data-end="5890">Extract $\Lie^*$ and compute eigen-spectrum</p>
</li>
<li data-start="5891" data-end="5939">
<p data-start="5894" data-end="5939">Test leaf containment and quotient divergence</p>
</li>
</ol>
<p data-start="5941" data-end="5953"><strong data-start="5941" data-end="5953">Verdict:</strong></p>
