<p data-start="6583" data-end="6680">A <strong data-start="6585" data-end="6680">full LaTeX paste-ready section with theorem boxes and TikZ diagrams for falsification paths</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start="6681" data-end="6763">
<p data-start="6684" data-end="6763">A <strong data-start="6686" data-end="6713">Python experiment suite</strong> implementing the above tests on a toy transformer</p>
</li>
<li data-start="6764" data-end="6795">
<p data-start="6767" data-end="6795">A <strong data-start="6769" data-end="6795">benchmark protocol PDF</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start="6796" data-end="6846">
